 "sentences": [
  "A commercial mission to save Swift failed.",
  "The observatory was losing altitude due to atmospheric drag.",
  "NASA hired Katalyst Space to boost the satellite's orbit.",
  "The new LINK spacecraft launched in less than a year.",
  "LINK experienced communication losses and orientation control issues.",
  "The mission shifted to testing robotic arms and propulsion instead.",
  "This effort provided valuable lessons for future in-space servicing."
